# Text files are LF in the repository and in every checkout, including on Windows: the pod script is
# copied to a Linux box and a CRLF there is a syntax error. Git detects binary files itself.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
*.mp4 binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.webp binary
*.woff2 binary
*.onnx binary
*.safetensors binary
